or: #666;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .iso-cert-label::before {\n    content: '●';\n    color: #f0a500;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .mechanism-title {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .mechanism-subtitle {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  .mechanism-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .mechanism-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .mechanism-label {\n    background: #fdf6e3;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #555;\n    min-width: 180px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .mechanism-arrow {\n    color: #f0a500;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .mechanism-desc {\n    border: 1.5px solid #f0a500;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #555;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .page-number-left {\n    left: 50px;\n  }\n  .page-number-right {\n    right: 50px;\n  }\n  .icon-people {\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .icon-people svg, .icon-org svg, .icon-audit svg {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    stroke: #f0a500;\n    fill: none;\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"spread\">\n  <!-- Page 115 -->\n  <div class=\"page page-left\">\n    <div class=\"page-header\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"main-title\">合规运营保障者</h1>\n\n    <p class=\"intro-text\">\n      合法合规经营是企业长远发展的根本保障，同时也是企业迈向国际化的重要必修课。美的集团始终将合规与稳健视为经营底线，通过从组织架构、制度体系、运行机制到企业文化等多方面着手，逐步构建起覆盖全方位的合规管理体系。\n    </p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">管理架构</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-desc\">\n      依托于三道防线的建设，我们不断完善相关机制，大力推进合规风险的识别、评估与防控工作落地。\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram-area\">\n      <div class=\"diagram-title\">合规管理体系</div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-main-box\">美的集团合规管理三道防线</div>\n\n      <div class=\"defense-lines\">\n        <div class=\"defense-line\">\n          <div class=\"defense-header\">第一道防线</div>\n          <div class=\"defense-dot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"defense-card\">\n            <div class=\"defense-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"14\" r=\"5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"14\" r=\"5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M8 38c0-6 4-10 8-10s8 4 8 10\"/>\n                <path d=\"M24 38c0-6 4-10 8-10s8 4 8 10\"/>\n                <rect x=\"28\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                <line x1=\"31\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"39\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                <line x1=\"31\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"37\" y2=\"13\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-title\">管理者、员工</div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-text\">合规风险所有者、管理者，负责本业务部门合规风险识别、评估、处置等</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"defense-line\">\n          <div class=\"defense-header\">第二道防线</div>\n          <div class=\"defense-dot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"defense-card\">\n            <div class=\"defense-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18\" r=\"4\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"18\" r=\"4\"/>\n                <path d=\"M14 36c0-6 5-10 10-10s10 4 10 10\"/>\n                <path d=\"M4 38c0-5 4-8 8-8s8 3 8 8\"/>\n                <path d=\"M28 38c0-5 4-8 8-8s8 3 8 8\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-title\">合规专门组织</div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-text\">牵头统筹协调、组织推动、督促落实</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"defense-line\">\n          <div class=\"defense-header\">第三道防线</div>\n          <div class=\"defense-dot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"defense-card\">\n            <div class=\"defense-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"16\"/>\n                <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"22\"/>\n                <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\"/>\n                <path d=\"M30 26l4 4 6-8\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-title\">审计、调查、稽查</div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card-text\">监督与持续改进</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number page-number-left\">115</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Page 116 -->\n  <div class=\"page page-right\">\n    <div class=\"nav-bar\">\n      <span>关于本报告</span>\n      <span>走进美的</span>\n      <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span class=\"nav-active\">共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span>附录</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"iso-box\">\n      <div class=\"iso-text\">\n        为持续完善合规体系建设和不断提升合规管理能力，美的集团由法务大合规中心和中国区域法务团队统筹，信息安全部门协助，成功获得ISO 37301:2021合规管理体系认证。该认证彰显了美的集团在合规管理方面的成熟度和专业水准，同时也为美的集团业务的持续稳健发展提供了坚实的基础。\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"iso-cert\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:13px; color:#333; margin-bottom:4px;\">bsi.</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; color:#333;\">Certificate of Registration</div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:8px; font-size:9px; color:#999; text-align:center;\">[Certificate Image]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"iso-cert-label\">ISO 37301：2021合规管理体系认证</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"mechanism-title\">管理制度与运行机制</h2>\n    <p class=\"mechanism-subtitle\">为强化合规管理，美的集团：</p>\n\n    <div class=\"mechanism-list\">\n      <div class=\"mechanism-item\">\n        <div class=\"mechanism-label\">建立动态风险<br>防控机制</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-arrow\">▶</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-desc\">定期开展风险自评，结合法律研究与风险预警体系，构建\"信息收集 - 风险标注 - 政策解读 - 预警发布 - 升级推送 - 反馈处理\"闭环机制。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mechanism-item\">\n        <div class=\"mechanism-label\">推进数字化合规建设</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-arrow\">▶</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-desc\">开发合规数字化系统，集成普适性服务功能与定制化场景解决方案，实现合规要求与业务流程深度融合。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mechanism-item\">\n        <div class=\"mechanism-label\">深化重点领域合规</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-arrow\">▶</div>\n        <div class=\"mechanism-desc\">2024 年持续强化贸易合规与数据合规建设，进一步夯实管理基础，确保全球监管适应性。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number page-number-right\">116</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
